From: AosEdge SDV Demo Maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] VAL v1: preserve the source timestamp in outgoing datapoints

The demo requires source-time preservation (REQ-VDP-004). Returning per-entry
receipt time destroys coherence across a single provider batch and can make
old source samples appear fresh. Retain receipt time only when no source time
was supplied. Do not change value-only conversions, authorization or storage.

